# tenshoe --input script: two pads, boot -> title -> main menu -> 2P VS -> selects -> race -> result.
# Steps are SysLib.frameCount (state.log F). Run 846 (agent-a); run 853 (agent-c): P2 needs its own
# board confirm (1500) before P1 picks the course; the race starts at ~1792 (flow 5,2,2). Both ride
# straight; on agent-a's tag-convention physics P2 retires at 3679 (health -2: P1 wins), the A presses
# go through the result to the next round (race state 1 again at ~4238).
PADS 2
F 480:3 START          # title
F 560:3 A
F 620:3 DD
F 680:3 DD
F 740:3 DD
F 800:3 DD
F 860:3 A
F 1100:3 P1 A P2 A
F 1200:3 P1 A P2 A
F 1300:3 P1 A P2 A
F 1400:3 P1 A P2 A
F 1500:3 P2 A
F 1600:3 P1 A
F 1700:3 P1 A
F 1800:3 P1 A
F 1900-3700 P1 STICK 0,80 P2 STICK 0,80
F 3900:3 P1 A
F 4050:3 P1 A
